194131/business/omans-refinery-products-output-reaches-1088-million-barrels-till-june-2026)\nciteturn102search4 [wordlim: 200] Published: 2 months ago; Crawled: last month; \n\n# Oman’s Refinery Products Output Reaches 108.8 million Barrels till June 2026\n\nPublished: 5:42 PM, Aug 08, 2026\n\nImage: The total output of refinery products in the Sultanate of Oman declined by 5.1% by the end of June 2026 to reach 108,849,200 barrels.\n\nThe total output of refinery products in the Sultanate of Oman declined by 5.1% by the end of June 2026 to reach 108,849,200 barrels.\n\nMuscat: The total output of refinery products in the Sultanate of Oman declined by 5.1% by the end of June 2026 to reach 108,849,200 barrels, compared with 114,662,900 barrels during the corresponding period in 2025. Total motor fuel production also decreased by 1.5% by the end of June 2026, according to the latest preliminary statistics issued by the National Centre for Statistics and Information (NCSI).\n\nThe statistics showed that production of regular (91 octane) petrol fell by 4.7% by the end of June 2026 to 8,251,000 barrels, compared with 8,659,100 barrels during the corresponding period in 2025.\n\nSales of regular (91 octane) petrol decreased by 13.3% to 7,857,300 barrels, compared with 9,065,500 barrels during the corresponding period in 2025. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nFIS | Ski Jumping Results - Courchevel (FRA) 2025/2026 (https://www.fis-ski.com/DB/general/results.html?competitorid=203125&raceid=7402&sectorcode=JP)\nciteturn102search5 [wordlim: 200] Published: 1.2 years ago; Crawled: last week; \n\n(120.35 kb)\n\nNations Cup Standing\n\ndownload\n\n(122.78 kb)\n\nEvent Program\n\ndownload\n\n(42.26 kb)\n\nGrand Prix Standings\n\ndownload\n\n(131.39 kb)\n\n### official results\n\nFilter\n\n[Input] [Input] [Input]\n\nNation\n\n[Input: SUI,USA]\n\nBirth Year\n\n[Input: 1972,1975 or 1980-1985]\n\n1st 108.8 STRATE Abigail\n\n2nd 108